			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* [misc(paper): Removed 1.20-1.21 support](https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/commit/3dd7552e6fe28cb94f7737180623751c51b90aa9)\n* [feat: Added support for Fabric 26.1+](https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/commit/daae808766ab3006a06e1e3b728c56467002286a)\n* [fix: Fixed late results applying to later messages](https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/commit/37900d63d6511529200164750f9f4f5f71edeeeb)\n* [fix(fabric): Fixed signed results not applying](https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/commit/ce0f309eabc6d3823a3c269848687984ac39b967)\n* [fix: Added waitForQueueProcessing property](https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/commit/0cd97590f8f60b30a336e0392ca2c15a0b063015) [(see more)](https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/wiki/Plugin-System-Properties#iogithub_4drian3dsignedvelocitywaitforqueueprocessing)\n\n## New Contributors\n* @SkippyzNJiff made their first contribution in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/268\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/compare/1.4.1...1.5.0"
