			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* Fixed VelocityCTD compatibility\n* Downgraded Sponge module version.\nThe supported versions are now SpongeAPI 10 (works exclusively with API 10) and SpongeAPI 12 (works with all versions above API 12 at the moment). This has been done because there is no functionality in SignedVelocitySponge that has been modified since API 12 (except for API 11, which has no support whatsoever)\n* Removed Sponge API 8 support\n* refactor: An internal module has been created to facilitate future modification and updating of the plugin.\n* fix(deps): update dependency net.minestom:minestom to v2025.09.13-1.21.8 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/167\n* fix(deps): update dependency net.fabricmc.fabric-api:fabric-api to v0.133.7+1.21.9 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/137\n* chore(deps): update gradle to v9.1.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/168\n* fix(deps): update dependency net.fabricmc.fabric-api:fabric-api to v0.133.10+1.21.9 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/169\n* fix(deps): update dependency net.fabricmc.fabric-api:fabric-api to v0.133.11+1.21.9 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/170\n* chore(deps): update dependency com.gradleup.shadow to v9.2.1 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/171\n* fix(deps): update dependency net.fabricmc.fabric-api:fabric-api to v0.133.12+1.21.9 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/173\n* chore(deps): update dependency com.gradleup.shadow to v9.2.2 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/174\n* fix(deps): update dependency net.fabricmc.fabric-api:fabric-api to v0.133.13+1.21.9 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/175\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/compare/1.4.0...1.4.1"
