			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* Fix channel registration in order to fix exploit by @hectogr3ms in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/116\n* fix(deps): update dependency org.slf4j:slf4j-api to v2.0.16 by @renovate in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/102\n* chore(deps): update dependency gradle to v8.10.2 by @renovate in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/104\n* fix(deps): update dependency net.fabricmc:fabric-loader to v0.16.9 by @renovate in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/105\n* chore(deps): update runvelocity to v2.3.1 by @renovate in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/106\n* fix(deps): update dependency org.bstats:bstats-velocity to v3.1.0 by @renovate in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/107\n* fix(deps): update dependency com.github.retrooper:packetevents-velocity to v2.5.0 by @renovate in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/110\n* chore(deps): update plugin idea-ext to v1.1.9 by @renovate in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/111\n* fix(deps): update dependency com.github.retrooper:packetevents-velocity to v2.6.0 by @renovate in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/121\n* fix(deps): update dependency org.jetbrains:annotations to v26 - autoclosed by @renovate in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/115\n* [fix: Fixed Chat handling on Fabric](https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/commit/bcdc65254fddbf1341182fa410838c20bcd4cfb9)\n* [feat: Published SignedVelocity Minestom module](https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/commit/7eaf668fced3c9728bf48cda724dadada185538f)\n  * From this version onwards, the Minestom module will be released as a library so that it can be easily integrated into any Minestom-based project.\n```kotlin\nrepositories {\n  mavenCentral()\n}\n\ndependencies {\n  implementation(\"io.github.4drian3d:signedvelocity-minestom:1.3.0\")\n}\n```\n\n## New Contributors\n* @hectogr3ms made their first contribution in https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/pull/116\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/4drian3d/SignedVelocity/compare/1.2.4...1.3.0"
